{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KhAefGxrvE1792734632.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新界東豪宅白石角分行經理曾嘉滙表示，近期二手交投氣氛持續暢旺，不少買家加快入市，火炭晉名峰最新錄E座高層A室，單位實用面積905平方呎，3房連套房及互人套房間隔，日前議價後以1,297萬元沽出，實用面積呎價約14,331元。<br/>中原曾嘉匯表示，新買家為同區客，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即購入單位自用。據了解，原業主於2013年以1,030萬元購入上址，持貨約13年，現轉手賬面獲利約267萬元或25.9%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:39.446409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T20:25:13.660340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:49.959471+00:00","content_hash":"48a8489f7fac25348f96ffb3fbfb2f9e54e0d89a2540e94bb83c8e3f678e33ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:39.446409+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}